  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.88,
      429.11,
      542.49,
      658.65
    ],
    "text": "Whereas a settlement notice under Section 4 of the Land Settlement Ordinance was duly published in the Gazette No. 64 of 23rd No-vember, 1979, and as otherwise required by the said Section, in respect of the lands situated in the area in Vavuniya South(Tamil) Divi-sional Revenue Officer\u2019s Division (Now Vavuniya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division) of the Vavuniya District in the Nothern Province and described as Lot no. 241 in Block Survey Topo No. 75 (North) (Vide Settlement Notice No. 4876 (Vavuniya)). And whereas all claims received in pursuance of the said notice have been duly dealt with in accordance with the provisions of the said Ordinance: I, the undersigned, in pursuance of the powers conferred on me by Section 5(5) of the said Ordinance do hereby make order that the lands or portions thereof be settled as specified in the Schedule to this order. D.M.M. DISSANAYAKA, Assistant Settlement Officer Commissioner of - Land Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, Battaramulla 11th October, 2016.",
